### EA4-392, 2026-11-12, run by hand: how PID 1 leaves the system bus after the denied fd
host ea4-352-el9 os=almalinux-9.8 systemd-252-67.el9_8.6.alma.1 dbus-broker-28-9.el9_8 selinux=Enforcing
strace -f -tt -p 1 -e trace=recvmsg,close,shutdown,connect, across one call:
systemd-run --quiet --uid=1000 --gid=1000 --pipe --wait --collect /bin/true </dev/null >/tmp/ea4-392.XXXXXX 2>&1

rc=1 Failed to start transient service unit: Remote peer disconnected

